<title>UK: TENNIS-1997 DAVIS CUP DRAW.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-1997 DAVIS CUP DRAW.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Draw for the first round of the</p>
<p>1997 Davis Cup competition made on Tuesday (*-denotes nation</p>
<p>with choice of venue):</p>
<p>World Group</p>
<p>United States v Brazil*</p>
<p>Netherlands v Romania*</p>
<p>France v Australia*</p>
<p>Czech Republic* v India</p>
<p>Mexico v Italy*</p>
<p>Spain* v Germany</p>
<p>South Africa* v Russia</p>
<p>Switzerland v Sweden*</p>
<p>Ties to be played from February 7 to 9, 1997</p>
